{
 "$comment": [
  "ENV-CLASS (#617; README.md, \"Configuration\"): the environment holds deployment constants only.",
  "`compose`: the class of each ${...} variable compose reads from compose.sops.env, which no Config declares (each binary's are in infra/env/<binary>.json).",
  "`moving`: a variable classed policy or source that is still read from the environment, with the issue that moves it out.",
  "`switches`: a bool classed deployment, which the owner confirmed (or is asked to confirm) is a fact of the deployment, not a switch.",
  "`envctl check` fails a stale entry, and in CI a moving or switches entry the base branch's copy lacks: those two lists only shrink."
 ],
